OL,3,GNEWSATwo Guernsey budgets to be
OL,4,Aproposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Policy and Resources (P&R)
OL,7,FCommittee is set to propose two budgets
OL,8,Ffor 2027 that deputies can vote on.
OL,10,FOne of the proposals will include a 1%
OL,11,Fcut in States spending, which was
OL,12,Fapproved by deputies last year,
OL,13,Ffollowing a move by Deputy Rhona
OL,14,FHumphreys.
OL,16,FThe other budget according to P&R's
OL,17,Ftreasury lead Charles Parkinson has
OL,18,Fbeen prepared more "traditionally" and
OL,19,Fwill include more expense.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
